  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iraqi Lingerie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Khanem International BV is a young company active in the trade of lingerie. The company collaborates with their store in Iraq (KRG), Elegant Lady Company, in Sulaimaniyah,  that is exclusively run by a female staff, guided by a &#x2018;by women for women&#x2019; philosophy.The growth of the company in combination with the improving market in the KRG and Iraq creates the possibility of scaling up the business operations. In order to facilitate this growth it is necessary to start producing private brand lingerie. After some trials with Colombian Producer companies, Khanem Fashion BV wants to finance the first order from these producing companies in order to be sold in the shop in Iraq. More alternative sourcing partners will be contacted and assessed for future collaboration. Furthermore a more professional webshop is developed to serve clients in the wider region.With this project the foundation is laid for a strong, internationally operating and future-proof company that contributes to good working conditions and the personal development of employees in several countries. It forms a solid basis for employees and the local economy in the event of any unrest or economic decline. With this project both impact is created in the countries where products are sourced (Colombia and in the future Sri Lanka).</narrative>
  </description>
